WEBVTT

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:03.500
has been elevated to an ideal.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.387
Now, together with this, we also have a belief

00:01:07.387 --> 00:01:10.155
in endless progress.

00:01:10.155 --> 00:01:12.911
But the underside of this ideology

00:01:12.911 --> 00:01:16.443
has been an increase of anxiety,

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.513
feelings of guilt,

00:01:18.513 --> 00:01:22.217
feelings of being inadequate,

00:01:22.217 --> 00:01:26.954
feeling that we are failing in our choices.

00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:30.950
Sadly, this ideology of individual choice